          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.14,
            0.859,
            0.176
          ],
          "content": "**Q.1. Draw a rectangle with sides of length 4 cm and 6 cm. After drawing, check if it satisfies both the rectangle properties.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.187,
            0.4,
            0.203
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** ∠A = ∠B = ∠C = ∠D = 90°"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.214,
            0.497,
            0.23
          ],
          "content": "AB = CD = 4   cm  \\quad \\&   AD  = BC = 6   cm .",
          "image_source": "images/page_32_equation_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.638,
            0.174,
            0.787,
            0.303
          ],
